    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2002560/extras/2017aef622f383df225c5635f6fd4e2c.poster.avif?t=1749148091\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2002560/extras/2017aef622f383df225c5635f6fd4e2c.webm?t=1749148091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stranded in the depths of an eerie forest after your car breaks down, you set out in search of help. But as you navigate the darkness, an unseen presence stalks you until it finally strikes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The adventure begins. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tales from Hoia Baciu Forest is a mini-game that will start a new series! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tales From Hoia Baciu is a first-person horror game free to play.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2002560/extras/c29a6acab96b729036c5fb7d77c61bd2.poster.avif?t=1749148091\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2002560/extras/c29a6acab96b729036c5fb7d77c61bd2.webm?t=1749148091\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2002560/extras/c29a6acab96b729036c5fb7d77c61bd2.mp4?t=1749148091\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Start an adventure </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start an adventure in the famous HOIA BACIU forest in Romania, living paranormal and creepy local stories.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fictional story.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Story-focused exploration - Explore the dark places of the people that you thought they are good and reveal their dark secrets.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Psychological Horror</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Tags:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Indie Horror Adventure Single Player</p></li></ul>",
